{"id":"da331f774e716a0a","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-martins-axiom-cons.md","title":"MA Consistency","display":"thm-martins-axiom-cons — MA Consistency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-martins-axiom-cons","aliases":["58-thm-martins-axiom-cons"],"display":"thm-martins-axiom-cons — MA Consistency","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]","[[58-df-theory-consistency-code.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-martins-axiom-cons"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-martins-axiom-cons</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martins-axiom-cons — MA Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed2709dc7cd09e87\" href=\"?note=ed2709dc7cd09e87\" title=\"../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md\">../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e47a2e0a535be05\" href=\"?note=3e47a2e0a535be05\" title=\"../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md\">../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e060283e46d1355\" href=\"?note=7e060283e46d1355\" title=\"58-df-theory-consistency-code.md\">58-df-theory-consistency-code.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Sent}_{58}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a> 的公理码集合；语法、一致性及加公理运算使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7e060283e46d1355\" href=\"?note=7e060283e46d1355\" title=\"58-df-theory-consistency-code.md\">58-df-theory-consistency-code.md</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ed2709dc7cd09e87\" href=\"?note=ed2709dc7cd09e87\" title=\"../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md\">../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md</a> 的完整 Martin 公理；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3e47a2e0a535be05\" href=\"?note=3e47a2e0a535be05\" title=\"../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md\">../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md</a> 的连续统假设。</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的实参中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MA}\">\\(\\mathrm{MA}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\mathrm{MA}_S\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{MA}_S\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CH}\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CH}\\urcorner\\)</span>；定义缩写均按其依赖中的公式展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\neg\\mathrm{CH}\\urcorner\\)</span>，而不是对代码作布尔求值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}cons}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{MA}+\\neg\\mathrm{CH})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}cons}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{MA}+\\neg\\mathrm{CH})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原有相对一致性蕴含；它们不是在 ZFC 中直接断言 MA、PFA 或 MM 成立。</li>\n<li>一致性不是一个可按大小比较的数值，本文没有把元数学蕴含替换为数值不等式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed2709dc7cd09e87","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-martin-axiom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md","status":"resolved","id":"3e47a2e0a535be05","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-theory-consistency-code.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e060283e46d1355","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headi